 "description": "Monster Hunt bosses C (phase 8 family 12): thirteen encounters of The Witchwood's Monster Hunt, ten of them with a passive hero power (Groddo the Bogwarden, Blood Witch Gretta, Forlorn Lovers, Cultist S'thara, Vitus the Exiled, Shudderwock, The Whisperer, Sephira Dusktalon, Gobbles, Ratcatcher Hannigul) and three with a clickable one (Winslow Tobtock, The Mute, Plaguemaster Rancel), and their two boss-only cards (Bloated Zombie, Infected Quillflinger). Boss deck lists are transcribed from hearthstone.wiki.gg boss pages (read 2026-11-14), by card name; tools/dungeon-run-catalog (step 'encounters') resolves the names against facts/violet-hold-2026-09.json, checks every card and writes data/dungeon-run/encounters-v1.json. The tier is the printed Health of the hero card (10 and 15: tier 1; 25 and 30: tier 2; 35 and 40: tier 3; 50 and more: tier 4).",
 "method": "Each boss page was read as wikitext (action=raw) and its one deck table transcribed in table order with the table's own counts by verify/tools/gen/p8f12/make_f12.py; a second, independent parse of the same pages gave the same lists and totals (30 for Groddo, Gretta, Forlorn Lovers, Vitus, The Whisperer, Sephira, Winslow, Hannigul and Rancel; 31 for Shudderwock; 20 for S'thara and The Mute; 12 for Gobbles). Boss-only cards carry their id; the wiki's names \"Witchwood's Touch (2)\", \"Windfury (card)\" and \"Silence (card)\" are written as the card names. The boss pages state no rules beyond the card texts: what a text leaves open is decided in the row's adaptation notes. The round of each boss is from https://hearthstone.wiki.gg/wiki/Monster_Hunt (read 2026-11-14).",
